abstract: "Versioned additive support for an exploratory documentary audit of a fixed historical corpus. Corrected R2 ratings and separate internal assessments, as declared by the authors, are preserved before AI-assisted technical conciliation. Earlier exports, results and protocols remain byte-exact historical snapshots. Agreement is not an accuracy estimate or external validation; no clinical treatment effect or complete source validation is claimed."
